{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "An Emotional Week", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Under Pressure", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Reported Speech and Questions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use reported speech when you are saying (reporting) what other people said. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you tell people what someone has said in the past, you need to change the verb to a tense further back in time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Direct Speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reported Speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">like</span> him.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">liked</span> him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"I'<span class=\\\"strong\\\">m coming</span> to the party.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">was coming.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"I already <span class=\\\"strong\\\">ate</span>.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had</span> already <span class=\\\"strong\\\">eaten</span>.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">can</span> cook.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He told me he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">could</span> cook.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"Where do you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">live</span>?\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He asked me where I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">lived</span>.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You have to change the pronoun if you are reporting what someone else said. Compare these two sentences. In each case the person actually said \"I don't want to go.\"", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>I said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >  I said <span class=\"strong\">I</span> didn't want to go.</li> <li>Bill said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >  Bill said <span class=\"strong\">he</span> didn't want to go.</li></ul>Look at the chart below to see the changes in verb tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Direct Speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reported Speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Perfect Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Future Simple (will)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Conditional (would)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">can</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">could</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">may\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">might\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">will\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Modal <span class=\\\"italic\\\">would\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "My boss said I wasn't very conscientious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I said I was really sorry. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " She did say that she was feeling overwhelmed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You explained that you had made a mistake.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking Hypothetically About the Past", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">could have</span>, <span class=\"italic\">should have</span> and <span class=\"italic\">would have</span> to talk about things that were possible in the past and may or may not have happened. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The structure: <br/><br/> Subject    + modal verb    + have     + verb (past participle)<br/> <span class=\"italic\">I             could              have        done<br/> You             should              have        made<br/> She            would               have        said</span><br/><br/>  You use <span class=\"italic\">could have</span> to talk about possibilities if something had been different in the past.<br/> For example: <span class=\"italic\">She could have been more specific.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should have</span> to talk about past events that did not happen and to speculate about events that may or may not have happened.<br/> For example: <span class=\"italic\">I should have confirmed the deadline time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should not have</span> to speculate negatively about what may or may not have happened.<br/> You also use <span class=\"italic\">should not have</span> to express regret for past actions.<br/><br/>  You use <span class=\"italic\">would have</span> to imagine a result if something had been different in the past.<br/> For example: <span class=\"italic\">You would have submitted your work on time if you had been certain of the time. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "* <span class=\"italic\">Would have</span> expresses more certainty about the result than <span class=\"italic\">could have</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I should have confirmed the deadline time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She could have been more specific about what she meant by \u201cend of the day\u201d. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You would have submitted your work on time if you had been certain of the time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "She shouldn't have taken it out on you.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to chew someone out", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to scold someone", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I got chewed out at work yesterday.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about reactions and behaviour in different situations.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "conscientious", "type": "name"}, {"content": "concerned with doing something correctly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: My boss said I wasn't very conscientious.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "specific", "type": "name"}, {"content": "special or particular", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She could have been more specific.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "communication", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the act or process of using words, sounds, signs, or behaviors to express or exchange information", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We talked about improving our communication.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "meticulous", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very careful about doing something in an exact way", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You're always punctual and meticulous.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "tone of voice ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the quality of a person's voice", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She was quite aggressive in her tone of voice.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take it out on someone", "type": "name"}, {"content": "direct your anger or frustration at a particular person", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: She shouldn't have taken it out on you.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "professional", "type": "name"}, {"content": "relating to a job that requires special education, training, or skill", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It's not professional but it happens to everyone.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le04ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Imagine that you made a mistake at work.", "type": "text"}, {"conte