ons", "contents": [{"content": "Everyone makes mistakes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn9le04ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hello?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hey, Sally! How's it going?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I'm really upset! I got chewed out at work yesterday. My boss said I wasn't very conscientious.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no! What happened?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It was my fault. I should have confirmed the deadline time. I handed in my blog assignment late. I feel really guilty. I should have asked what she meant by \u201cend of the day\u201d.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Did you tell her it was a misunderstanding? She could have been more specific about what she meant by \u201cend of the day.\u201d", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn9le04ob02re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: We talked about improving our communication. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Good. I'm sure she knows that you would have submitted your work on time if you had been certain of the time. You're always punctual and meticulous.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She was quite aggressive in her tone of voice. I said I was really sorry. I know I'm sensitive sometimes and I screwed up, but I think she overreacted.", "id": 2, "time": "29000", "image": "engenn9le04ob02re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, maybe she was having a bad day, but she shouldn't have taken it out on you. It's not professional but it happens to everyone.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: She did say that she was feeling overwhelmed. It's been really busy at the magazine.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, you explained that you had made a mistake and you apologized. To avoid these misunderstandings just make sure you always communicate clearly, and you'll be fine. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, Vanessa!", "id": 3, "time": "50500", "image": "engenn9le04ob02re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le04ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le04ob02re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}